# Example Vault KV v2 secret at secret/kubepilot/ios (flat path).
# Store these fields in Vault — never commit real values.
#
#   ASC_KEY_ID              App Store Connect API key id
#   ASC_ISSUER_ID           App Store Connect issuer id
#   ASC_PRIVATE_KEY_B64     base64(AuthKey_XXXXXX.p8)
#   CERT_PRIVATE_KEY_B64    base64(distribution private key .pem)
#   APPLE_TEAM_ID           10-char Apple Developer team id (optional if inferred)
#   APP_STORE_APP_ID        numeric App Store Connect app id (optional)
